    <briefdescription>
<para>Cache key for <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_basic_a_a" kindref="compound">BasicAA</ref> results. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It only includes the pointer and size from <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_memory_location" kindref="compound">MemoryLocation</ref>, as <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_basic_a_a" kindref="compound">BasicAA</ref> is AATags independent. Additionally, it includes the value of MayBeCrossIteration, which may affect <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_basic_a_a" kindref="compound">BasicAA</ref> results. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
